  m_text: "An array is one variable that holds many values of one type. Light[] lights holds four Light components, dragged into its slots in the Inspector. Each slot has a number, its index. The first slot is number 0, so lights[0] is the first light.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> Lamps 1 holds four lights. What is the index of the last one?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select Lamps 1. In the Inspector, open Lights.\n2. Press Play and click 1 \xB7 Switch lights[0].\n3. Drag Lamp C into Element 0, and click again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
