  m_text: "A for loop repeats its body. for (int i = 0; i < count; i++) starts i at 0, runs the body while i is less than count, and adds 1 to i after each pass: i++ is i = i + 1. Each pass places one cube at a position set by i.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> count is 5. After one click, what number does Code Watch show beside the lines of the loop's body?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play, select Cube Row 2 and open Code Watch.\n2. Click 2 \xB7 Build the row. Read the number beside the body.\n3. Set Count to 8, and click again."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
