      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "An array has a fixed number of slots. A List can grow: Add puts one more value at its end. While isRecording is true, FixedUpdate adds the ball's position at each physics step. PlayBackwards fills a second list with a for loop that counts down, from the last to the first.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You click 6 \xB7 Record, then 6 \xB7 Play backwards. Where does the ball stop?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Press Play. Select Ball 6 and find Positions in the Inspector.\n2. Click 6 \xB7 Record, and watch its size grow.\n3. When the ball stops, click 6 \xB7 Play backwards."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 2f7116f10747a67409388e93052ae222, type: 2}
